WEBVTT

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:44.580
February...

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:49.030
We've finally plunged into the
college entrance exam season.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.950
You're a scheduling genius
to take so many exams.

00:01:58.470 --> 00:01:59.930
At least he's
enthusiastic.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.510
But enthusiasm won't
give him brains.

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.710
Hey, you guys...

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.620
His pelt lacks luster.
His snout is too dry.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:14.120
His tongue
wants for color.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.830
in summary, he is in
a state of ill health.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.680
What do you
know about it?

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.590
I was ready to bet on
today's exam to show, but...

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.640
A waste of money.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:28.390
l bet that he
flunks them all!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.220
There's no
odds-on favorite.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.340
You haven't
forgotten anything?

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:49.820
I'm fine.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.590
Your admission l.D.?

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.410
Come on.
It's right here, see?

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:56.560
''K'' University

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:57.590
See?

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:01.280
Isn't today
''N '' University?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.290
Yes! It's my
back-up plan.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:06.820
But isn't that the
l.D. for ''K'' University?

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.210
l-I'll be fine
this time!

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:33.960
Godai!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:38.680
You can do it!

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.070
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.080
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.050
Idiot!

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.250
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:05.250
Watch out!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.970
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.600
If he's this bad on the first
one, I wonder about the rest.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.210
He's the
manager's pet.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:18.690
The way you
dote on the ronin.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.210
Youth has
advantages.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:23.160
W-Wait a second.
What are you talking about?

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.880
You're in love with
the ronin, right?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.820
H-How do you
get these ideas?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.590
Godai!
You can do it!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.410
Will you
stop that?

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:39.940
It's only natural for a manager
to worry about her tenants!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.590
Godai!
You can do it!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.000
OH, SHUT UP!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:49.950
If Godai fails this year
as well, it's your fault, too!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.460
The manager is
really mad, this time.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.090
Yeah, but...

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.810
''Godai!
You can do it! ''

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.950
Listen to her!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.660
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.730
First test.
First failure.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.870
They haven't
posted results yet!

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.410
Total failure
however...

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.450
One down in flames
but lots to go.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:53.700
If quality lacks,
quantity suffices.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.420
Keep up the bad work,
and I'll be in the money!

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:00.370
This isn't
helping at all!

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:09.590
I wasn't trying to help Akemi',
but I kept failing my tests.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:14.260
And I only had
a few more left...

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.960
Godai!
You can do it!

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:20.270
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.550
Godai!
You can do it!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.620
Yes!

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:39.960
Godai!
You can do it!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.470
Yes!
I'll do it!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.100
I'm home, Soichiro.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.440
Did you have
lunch yet?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.820
ls Godai''s
exam going well?

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.750
G-Godai!
How dare you?

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.420
Does the ronin
do that often?

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:43.160
Mrs. Ichinose, please
stop the bad jokes.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:49.120
You've got nice hips. You can
have a flock of kids with those.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.500
What are we
talking about?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.770
I'll stop by later with
some coffee cake.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.760
B-But...
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:07.160
- - An arranged marriage!?
- - Just take a look.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.910
I got loads of 'em.
How about this one?

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.850
He's a doctor.
Look.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.920
This one? He's a hunk.
Graduated from ''K'' university.

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.420
I-I don't...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:24.450
No? You're pretty picky.
What about this one...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.500
I...

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:28.580
Gee, THAT was Fun.

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:37.150
The next college i's my favorite,
but that's the hardest test.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.450
So what type
do you like?

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.650
I don't really...

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.290
You should at least try
meeting one of them.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.280
But...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.020
I haven't even
thought of marriage.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:53.650
Why not?
You're in your prime.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:55.350
And you're not
in love, right?

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:01.080
Well, I am
and I'm not!.

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.730
Are you? Aren't you?
SAY something!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.260
So you haven't
settled on him, yet?

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.390
Or rather, I'm still
in transition.

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.180
So where is
this guy?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.090
He's always nearby.
He truly loves me.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.290
And l...

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:33.390
I should just tell her...

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.900
...about Soichiro.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.920
So you love the
ronin that much?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:45.840
R-Really?

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:49.100
W-What does Godai have
to do with anything!?

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:54.720
He fits everything you said.
You're always worried about him...

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.920
When was l
worried about him?

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.150
Just this morning...

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.050
Eeek! Godai!

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.340
Etc.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.500
Don't do that!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.580
What? She
called out my name?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:06.830
I'm so happy!

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.720
Give up on him, huh?
He's got no future.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.450
What was that?

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:17.600
Even if he lucks into college,
it'll be second-rate at best.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.280
He's got
no talent...

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.460
Physically,
he's a wimp...

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:24.880
And you can't count
on younger men.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:30.470
You don't have
to go that far.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.350
A one-year ronin
is normal.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:37.530
And he's a
nice gentleman.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.830
A man's heart is
what's most important!

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:46.630
Hurrah! Hurrah!
Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:49.700
Banzai! Banzai!

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.090
Hurrah, Hurrah...

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.250
What a dunce.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.500
Okay, I get the point.
We'll talk again later.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.300
Mrs. Ichinose, wait!

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:05.480
I can't let you leave like this.
I've got something else...

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.890
I know. Nobody'll
tell the ronin about it.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.120
YOU!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:19.750
Were you
eavesdropping?

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:22.890
What kind of
man are you?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.220
C'mere!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.750
Idiot!
Why are you blushing?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:38.960
They'll
get it wrong!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.330
Forgive me,
Soichiro!

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:47.220
You really are the worst!
Eavesdropping on women-talk.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:48.500
Right!

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.880
But you're always so loud. I'd
hear you even if I didn't try.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:55.480
Why'd you glue your
ear to the door?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:57.710
Right!
Absolutely!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.830
Don't you understand
a woman's heart?

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.330
You gonna make
me spell it out!?

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:11.850
It's because she loves you that
she has to keep it a secret!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.230
She couldn't distract you with
her feelings during your exams.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:29.680
S...

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.030
So that's it!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.290
That's it, all right.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.090
So that's how it is.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:38.250
I knew that's
how it was.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.620
T-They've got this horribly...

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.330
...wrong!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.250
I'm going, Soichiro!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.510
Your teeth are all
dirty! Brush 'em!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.410
I'm going!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.620
I'm going!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:17.930
I'm going!

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.020
I'm going!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.210
Oh, shut up! So when
are you going to go!?

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.000
Don't be late for
your favorite college.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:28.710
Y-Yeah...
I'm sorry.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.840
Got no choice, I guess.
Hold it a second.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.930
Godai!
You can do it!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:39.980
STOP THAT!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:50.720
I won't let this
misunderstanding go on!

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.050
He's gone.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.770
The typical
Exam Hell student.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:18.140
That's the look.
I'll bet he's a ronin!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.840
Kyoko...

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.530
Godai!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.690
Manager!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.430
Godai! Congratulations!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.120
Would you accept a kiss as
a present for your acceptance!?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.100
Manager!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:52.940
So much for
this year's exams.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.310
Meidai-Mae Station.
Meidai-Mae Station.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.150
The train is
leaving the station.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:57.890
Oh, no!

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.310
Finished already?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.860
Never mind.
Well done.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:53.300
Clock Hill Shopping District

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.420
I was a little immature
and selfish, wasn't l?

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:02.790
And this test was
his most important.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.500
He should be taking
the test right now.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.720
Godai'!
You can do it!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:20.230
No, Soichiro! I was just
doing it as his manager...

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.640
It's true! There is
absolutely nothing between us!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.800
Please believe me
Soichiro!

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.290
ls this called
animal husbandry?

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.550
Some kinda
performance art?

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.650
You think we
should call the SPCA?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.140
Some weird
forbidden love?

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.850
Maybe she won
the lottery?

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.310
What i's
wrong with me?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.270
Godai!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.780
Come one, come all! Come to
Uwasu-no-Toraya Pachinko!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.620
Grand opening!

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.270
Play, win,
and get your prizes!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.270
Today, the odds
are in your favor!

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:19.930
Whaddya know,
another winner!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:25.000
I'm a Fool. Godai'
wouldn't be in such a place...

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:35.050
There's one!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.960
Pal, would
you cut that out?

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.940
Oh, no. I am
worried about him.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.940
But that's one
of a manager's duties!

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.280
Manager?

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.060
Y-You've got
it wrong...

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:03.620
What?

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.060
N-Nothing!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.170
Mamezo

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:14.720
C'mon in!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.500
Come on in.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.150
This is my
favorite joint.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.250
But drinking
in the afternoon...

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.830
So where
should we sit...

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.800
Take a seat at a table!
It's comfy there.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.330
W-Why is Kyoko here?

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.820
Beer! And cuttlefish
and chicken meatballs for two.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:37.400
W-What'll I do?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.010
Mister
you feelin' okay?

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.760
Any other exits?

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:45.530
I have...

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.300
...BUT ONE!

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:50.730
Drinks are best for
when you're worried...

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:55.040
I'm not worried...

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.130
You're not worried
about this morning?

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:01.090
Yeah, but it was
concern, pure and simple.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.060
Pure love?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:04.980
Come on!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.930
You sure can
chug it!

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.000
I am his manager!

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:16.610
Yep, one more!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.820
A manager should
worry about her tenants!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.460
Lady, your bill!?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.160
Are you sure
that's all?

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:36.350
l...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:47.250
Whatever.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.230
- - Time to go?
- - Let me hit the john.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:51.640
Oh, no!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:19.810
What an idiot!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:26.720
L-Look here!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:28.900
H-Here.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.190
Uh, thanks.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:34.030
Shall we?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:36.880
Come again...!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:40.520
Oh, no! I forgot
my cigarettes.

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:41.480
Me, too.

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.890
He should be right in the
middle of the afternoon tests.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:46.590
I feel sick...

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.120
Better go to the can. We
still got drinkin' to do.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:05.850
Watch out!

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.610
I'm sorry!

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:08.820
Are you okay?

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:37.210
Godai! What
are you doing here!?

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:42.290
All the questions were too hard,
so I figured I was doomed...

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.010
You couldn't have
left in the middle...

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:50.400
Couldn't or could.
He's eating here, ain't he?

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:53.280
I just...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.050
I'm sick of it! Now
I'm really sick of it!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:59.540
Listen, you...

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:02.800
I'm going with you
to the next test!

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:06.290
I'll guard the exits
so you can't run away!

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:10.490
Wait a second. I'm no
child that you have to...

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:14.710
You're acting so childish!
Gotta watch you like a hawk!

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:19.060
Got it!?
It's decided!

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:21.080
Y-Yes'm.

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:38.850
Godai, what
is she to you?

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:42.600
She had to come along.
Wouldn't take no for an answer.

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:46.240
Godai, I hate
to ask again...

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:48.710
Yes, Manager? What is it?

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:51.960
Did I really say
I'd come with you?

00:22:53.060 --> 00:22:56.100
Exactly what you said!
Mrs. Ichinose witnessed it.

00:22:58.400 --> 00:22:59.980
You wanna go in?

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.800
Could you do
''it '' once more?

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:10.000
Godai
you can do it.

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:14.070
Today I think
I really can!

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.090
Godai, your bag!

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:28.650
Moron! What are
you thinking of?

00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:29.740
Idiot!

00:23:39.110 --> 00:23:42.420
I get the feeling I've got an
undependable younger brother.

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:52.620
''Failing his entrance exams,
a ronin jumps from a building. ''

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:55.320
No! Godai
would never...

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:59.520
Next:. ''Kyoko's Climbing the Walls!
Godai's Headed for the Hills. ''

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.630
Godai! Please
hurry home!

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:05.800
I just know you'll
get into college!
